            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review summarizes available data concerning fenoprofen. The pharmacodynamics, in vivo interactions, gastrointestinal microbleeding, screening for anti-inflammatory action, and tests for antipyretic and analgesic efficacy are discussed.</AbstractText>
